stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: CreateExam (is_draft=true)
    Draft --> Published: UpdateExam(is_draft=false) when start_time set
    Draft --> Draft: edit content / metadata
    Published --> Upcoming: now < start_time
    Published --> Active: start_time <= now <= end_time
    Published --> Completed: now > end_time
    Active --> Completed: end_time elapsed (or CloseExam)
    Completed --> Active: ReopenExam(minutes)
    Active --> Active: AssignExam to more classes
    Published --> Reset: ResetExam (sets reset_at, invalidates sessions)
    Reset --> Active: reset complete

    note right of Draft
      attempts blocked
      not visible to students
    end note
    note right of Active
      students may start/resume
      reminders fire
    end note
